{"versions":[{"path":"versions/f7fa496f-69e1-456f-8987-31f2313f62ad/679eb40430648d69378896a78d3cb53aa89c0ad63dad73a1b7490c45f93bcacb.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"f7fa496f-69e1-456f-8987-31f2313f62ad","revision":"sha256:679eb40430648d69378896a78d3cb53aa89c0ad63dad73a1b7490c45f93bcacb","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-1\nWord stemming is to eliminate the commonly used words from the original documents."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"a7aa7ca6-4711-4adc-8507-64cc28a9a670"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"4ddf18f7-eebf-40b5-9602-fcdcd2cbe1ff"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"词干提取把同源词的不同形式归并到词干, 如 connected 和 connecting 归并到 connect; 删除常用词属于停用词过滤"}]}}},{"path":"versions/f55f35dd-7769-49a0-a234-db520761a01c/20e6ec51d916a0a0f43fda6d00660389150191ab0c83cbde9aa0beade06d7d70.json","value":{"schema_version":3,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"f55f35dd-7769-49a0-a234-db520761a01c","revision":"sha256:20e6ec51d916a0a0f43fda6d00660389150191ab0c83cbde9aa0beade06d7d70","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-2\nA 2-3 tree with 12 leaves may have at most 11 nonleaf nodes."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"f635b360-7738-4305-b758-4da11082eb75"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"67a933df-c4a8-40e1-8a32-51f2afd3b7cc"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"争议说明: at most 可表示非紧上界, 也可能指最大可达值, 存在歧义"}],"answer_status":"unavailable","selection_mode":"single"}}},{"path":"versions/4ad96974-c2d9-4163-bf13-97202efddade/978ad408b13ec6ff744a8d369d9c7fd9bd69e3e79c46f93b5d690a8e61efa1de.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"4ad96974-c2d9-4163-bf13-97202efddade","revision":"sha256:978ad408b13ec6ff744a8d369d9c7fd9bd69e3e79c46f93b5d690a8e61efa1de","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-3\nFor the document-partitioned strategy in distributed indexing, each node contains a subset of all documents that have a specific range of index."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"dcc679bd-1ec5-4f3a-b4e8-0d9bcfd02e6b"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"f425dae1-19a1-4a52-995b-81e69eb41635"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"文档分片按文档编号或分配范围把文档集合分给不同节点, 每个节点为自己负责的文档构建索引"}]}}},{"path":"versions/b39abc85-67c5-4760-abcf-a8ab3fca299d/569e7dfe86a47de13c651d4d500438904d08bf3df68e59ec6c5dde98ea923464.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"b39abc85-67c5-4760-abcf-a8ab3fca299d","revision":"sha256:569e7dfe86a47de13c651d4d500438904d08bf3df68e59ec6c5dde98ea923464","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-4\nIn a red-black tree, the number of internal nodes in the subtree rooted at x is no more than 2^bh(x) − 1 where bh(x) is the black-height of x."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"a89175d6-9f2e-4b27-b0bd-908a68d02472"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"be420bea-af89-4edc-9a0a-1a4294d964da"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"红黑树的标准引理是至少有 2^bh(x)−1 个内部结点, 这是下界. 例如黑根带两个红孩子的子树即可超过该下界"}]}}},{"path":"versions/cc28b8db-742c-4add-9a18-2939133ae4e7/0452c51bba8e1a4442e8746107e9ed29b7d935d50d449c5718e006743d9c28f8.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"cc28b8db-742c-4add-9a18-2939133ae4e7","revision":"sha256:0452c51bba8e1a4442e8746107e9ed29b7d935d50d449c5718e006743d9c28f8","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-5\nWhen measuring the relevancy of the answer set, if the precision is high but the recall is low, it means that most of the relevant documents are retrieved, but too many irrelevant documents are returned as well."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"cb2e67dd-837b-44aa-894a-f0a01ae6c59f"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"56d85355-255f-44d0-bfc9-68a18c2b4003"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"高 precision 表示检索到的文档中相关比例高; 低 recall 表示所有相关文档中只找回较小比例, 这与给出的解释相反"}]}}},{"path":"versions/96a744f1-fd34-4725-950f-f3f1d9e54b58/16c4cc17b99200b8ec5c89f4da4622d7a8aa2b43ea224ab2b9948f36ffcffe06.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"96a744f1-fd34-4725-950f-f3f1d9e54b58","revision":"sha256:16c4cc17b99200b8ec5c89f4da4622d7a8aa2b43ea224ab2b9948f36ffcffe06","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-6\nFor any black node X in a Red-Black tree, if it has two children, then the children's colors may be different."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"ce893536-b734-4291-a710-01a60f849be7"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"d61e73e2-3fe2-48c2-af74-c42b294ffb07"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"可以让 X 的一个孩子是黑叶, 另一个孩子为红结点且具有两个黑孩子, 所有相关路径黑高相同, 红结点也无红孩子"}]}}},{"path":"versions/170fe444-90ed-4098-aabb-86eb221715d2/65100e6ad1657697bbd207cf93d31221e03e6d766acf7c93e9af7eee44b57d66.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"170fe444-90ed-4098-aabb-86eb221715d2","revision":"sha256:65100e6ad1657697bbd207cf93d31221e03e6d766acf7c93e9af7eee44b57d66","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-7\nInverted file contains a list of pointers to all occurrences of a term in the text."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"84d3ec16-12f5-4d91-a9d3-69dbccd06e11"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"1dfc8bea-d2da-4671-9d96-d0edf84eac12"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"倒排文件为词项保存指向相关文档或出现位置的列表; 具体实现可能只保存文档级指针或额外保存位置"}]}}},{"path":"versions/13e7a761-83c9-4d38-81be-3c6ff12574d2/3fff8a90e8dd09a53b11e505eec48e9c79fd18f93fa6ed2b62769b3d780499e2.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"13e7a761-83c9-4d38-81be-3c6ff12574d2","revision":"sha256:3fff8a90e8dd09a53b11e505eec48e9c79fd18f93fa6ed2b62769b3d780499e2","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-8\nThe time bound of the FIND operation in a B+ tree containing N numbers is O(log N), no matter what the degree of the tree is."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"b43177a9-208b-4a23-a74e-9bc70a31ecf7"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"89950f8e-8655-492e-803b-7f3cbb5a15a6"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"B+ 树保持平衡, 阶数为 M（M≥3）时树高为 $O(\\log_M N)$; 每层用二分查找需 $O(\\log M)$, 因此总查找时间为 $O(\\log N)$"}]}}},{"path":"versions/36808fb8-3493-45f3-b552-f90e6acfd1bb/b174e1b16304a1ee92ec98cbd92b7e6d595a385b5e073ee61a1b5065e047929a.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"36808fb8-3493-45f3-b552-f90e6acfd1bb","revision":"sha256:b174e1b16304a1ee92ec98cbd92b7e6d595a385b5e073ee61a1b5065e047929a","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-9\nWhile accessing a term stored in a B+ tree in an inverted file index, range searchings are expensive."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"d0ddbaea-d86d-4304-b5c8-4315057d0945"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"1ca068b4-5720-41a7-801d-634f4177a7b1"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"B+ 树按键顺序组织叶结点, 找到范围起点后可以沿叶结点顺序扫描, 范围查询是它的常见优势"}]}}},{"path":"versions/6c523b72-3540-451d-b2d9-519ead0d584b/48b816f99e7a47f50527a6c592390dfbbdc7c45e2ebeb5734e28dc6fa8106334.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"6c523b72-3540-451d-b2d9-519ead0d584b","revision":"sha256:48b816f99e7a47f50527a6c592390dfbbdc7c45e2ebeb5734e28dc6fa8106334","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-10\nIn a B+ Tree, an internal node with k children stores k−1 smallest key values in the subtrees except the first one."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"226f1c15-6a6f-44bb-a6d6-b60f6cce7a21"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"a35476c2-d293-4cf0-a3fe-ea752a665d74"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"分隔键取各个非首孩子子树的最小键, k 个孩子对应 k−1 个此类分隔键"}]}}},{"path":"versions/04bbf3b6-b4c2-42f3-b6fb-9592df1768c5/c8be15147d0d68ba1a5762ecb9d10dd29b84e0f5b1a506e14fe856505f17c2b8.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"04bbf3b6-b4c2-42f3-b6fb-9592df1768c5","revision":"sha256:c8be15147d0d68ba1a5762ecb9d10dd29b84e0f5b1a506e14fe856505f17c2b8","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-11\nPrecision measures the quality of all the retrieved documents."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"a3960874-2229-4110-90f4-e8659282ba10"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"196aaffb-6345-4f1d-b3c6-1b3602333b53"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"Precision 是检索结果中相关文档所占比例, 用来衡量返回结果的相关质量"}]}}}]}